"\n\n\n\n\n## Review\nIf you like , this is a special lecture you must never miss.  \nRecently, my interest shifted from psychology to brain science.  \nI thought that to understand human psychology more deeply, I should know about the more fundamental .  \nPerhaps that's why I could read this book more enjoyably and interestingly.  \n\nThis book makes the reader ask 'why?' about things they took for granted and look at the familiar world and phenomena from a new perspective.  \nI think it is an excellent popular science book that allows one to look into the human heart with the microscope of brain science and view society and the future with the telescope of complex systems science.  "